<br/>
The vehicle view provides access to features such as climate, charging, and security, alongside a large rendering of the car and shortcuts for vehicle controls. The home energy view displays power flowing between solar panels, a Powerwall, the home, and the grid.<br/>
<br/>
Tesla's design team <a href="https://x.com/AlexGuichet/status/2112933609153937513">reworked multiple views</a> to take advantage of the additional space, with further refinements planned for future releases.<br/>
<br/>
The update follows Apple's <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/10/05/apple-opens-iphone-duo-app-submissions/">opening of App Store submissions</a> for &zwnj;iPhone Duo&zwnj; apps earlier this month. Existing iPhone apps can run on the device, but apps need to be built with the iOS 27.1 SDK or later to dynamically resize to fill its inner display. Unoptimized apps appear with black borders.<br/>
<br/>
